992
00:40:31.120 --> 00:40:32.560
And we have structural flow.

993
00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:35.920
Structural flow is pretty simple.

994
00:40:35.920 --> 00:40:37.040
There are three different types.

995
00:40:37.040 --> 00:40:38.520
There is pro-trend only.

996
00:40:38.520 --> 00:40:42.840
So pro-trend only is when there is no internal structure.

997
00:40:42.840 --> 00:40:46.080
You are bullish and there's no internal structure.

998
00:40:46.080 --> 00:40:47.840
You're bearish and there's no internal structure.

999
00:40:47.840 --> 00:40:51.600
So when you're tagging a trade, its own is pro-trend only.

1000
00:40:51.600 --> 00:40:55.320
Now you may have counter-internal.

1001
00:40:55.320 --> 00:40:56.760
Counter-internal is your bullish,

1002
00:40:56.760 --> 00:40:58.520
but the internal structure is bearish

1003
00:40:58.520 --> 00:41:00.480
and now you take a long position.

1004
00:41:00.480 --> 00:41:03.480
And then obviously pro-internal is when you're bullish

1005
00:41:03.480 --> 00:41:05.240
and the internal was bearish

1006
00:41:05.240 --> 00:41:06.280
and then it shifts bullish.

1007
00:41:06.280 --> 00:41:09.800
And so now you have a bullish external and bullish internal

1008
00:41:09.800 --> 00:41:12.120
or bearish external and bearish internal.

1009
00:41:12.120 --> 00:41:13.120
And this is a really interesting one

